WEBVTT

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:11.950
别动。
Don't move.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.300
告诉我……
Tell me...

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.100
你到底是从哪里来的？
Where did you come from?

00:00:20.301 --> 00:00:22.601
你：（不挣开）我是楼上宴会的摄影师。你的眼睛怎么回事？
You: (Don't pull away.) I'm the photographer for the party upstairs. What's wrong with your eyes?
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 1 轮 · Realtime round 1）

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:27.525
摄影师。
A photographer.

00:00:27.725 --> 00:00:32.549
眼睛？那是你害的。
The eyes? That's your doing.

00:00:32.749 --> 00:00:35.061
Harland把订婚宣布提前了，还有十分钟。
Harland moved the engagement up. Ten minutes.

00:00:35.261 --> 00:00:37.573
Luca，关掉车库监控。
Luca. Kill the garage cameras.

00:00:42.897 --> 00:00:45.197
你：你先说清楚，订婚是谁的订婚？
You: Explain first. Whose engagement are you talking about?
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 2 轮 · Realtime round 2）

00:00:45.297 --> 00:00:50.121
“是我的。”
Mine.

00:00:55.345 --> 00:00:57.657
“Mate。这就是你对我的意义。”
Mate. That's what you are to me.

00:01:00.369 --> 00:01:02.681
“我是在保护你。跟我走。”
I'm keeping you safe. Come with me.

00:01:05.493 --> 00:01:07.793
你：我凭什么信你？先说清楚Mate是什么意思。
You: Why should I trust you? First tell me what Mate means.
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 3 轮 · Realtime round 3）

00:01:07.893 --> 00:01:12.717
你不必信我。
You don't have to trust me.

00:01:12.917 --> 00:01:17.741
只有一个人，高于一切。
One person. Above everything.

00:01:17.941 --> 00:01:20.253
跟我来。
Come with me.

00:01:22.965 --> 00:01:25.277
路上我给你解释。
I'll explain on the way.

00:01:28.089 --> 00:01:30.389
你：把手覆上他攥紧的拳头
You: Cover his clenched fist with your hand
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 4 轮 · Realtime round 4）

00:01:35.513 --> 00:01:40.337
你的手很暖。
You're warm.

00:01:43.049 --> 00:01:45.361
小心点。我快撑不住了。
Careful. I'm barely holding on.

00:01:48.073 --> 00:01:50.385
他们会来找你。让他们来。
They'll come looking for you. Let them.

00:01:50.685 --> 00:01:52.985
你：谁的电话？你为什么不接？
You: Whose call is it? Why aren't you answering?
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 5 轮 · Realtime round 5）

00:01:53.085 --> 00:01:57.909
Selene。今晚不接。
Selene. Not tonight.

00:02:03.133 --> 00:02:05.445
我选了你。
I chose you.

00:02:08.157 --> 00:02:10.469
是我的气味。会好的。
It's my scent. It'll settle.

00:02:13.281 --> 00:02:15.581
你：不是人类？那你到底是什么？说清楚。
You: Not human? Then what exactly are you? Explain properly.
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 6 轮 · Realtime round 6）

00:02:15.681 --> 00:02:20.505
我是狼人，一族的Alpha。
Wolf. Alpha of my pack.

00:02:30.753 --> 00:02:33.065
我已经离开了那场订婚。Selene从来都不是我的。
I walked out on the engagement. Selene was never mine.

00:02:33.265 --> 00:02:35.577
你在发抖。
You're shaking.

00:02:35.877 --> 00:02:38.177
你：走近一步，直视他的眼睛
You: Step closer and look him straight in the eyes
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 7 轮 · Realtime round 7）

00:02:43.301 --> 00:02:48.125
“我还是我。”
I'm still me.

00:02:48.325 --> 00:02:50.637
“进来吧。”
Come inside.

00:02:53.349 --> 00:02:55.661
门外Luca：“Arkwright小姐，他今晚不见任何人。”
Miss Arkwright, he's not receiving anyone.

00:02:58.473 --> 00:03:00.773
你：Arkwright？她是谁？为什么要拦她？
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 8 轮 · Realtime round 8）

00:03:00.873 --> 00:03:05.697
Selene。我的订婚对象。
Selene. My engagement.

00:03:10.921 --> 00:03:13.233
让她进来。
Let her in.

00:03:13.433 --> 00:03:15.745
原来是真的。
So it's true.

00:03:21.069 --> 00:03:23.369
你：伸手贴上他的脸侧
You: Place a hand against the side of his face
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 9 轮 · Realtime round 9）

00:03:28.493 --> 00:03:33.317
待着。
Stay.

00:03:38.541 --> 00:03:40.853
那是什么？
Then what is it?

00:03:41.053 --> 00:03:43.365
留下来陪我。求你。
Stay with me. Please.

00:03:43.665 --> 00:03:45.965
你：好，我留下来。但你得先把Selene的事处理干净。
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 10 轮 · Realtime round 10）

00:03:46.065 --> 00:03:49.214
明白了。
Understood.

00:03:56.113 --> 00:03:57.923
Luca，告诉Selene，到此为止。
Luca. Tell Selene it's over.

00:03:58.123 --> 00:03:59.932
是，Alpha。
Yes, Alpha.

00:04:06.261 --> 00:04:08.561
你：捧住他的脸吻上去
You: Cup his face and kiss him
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 11 轮 · Realtime round 11）

00:04:13.685 --> 00:04:18.509
过来。
Come here.

00:04:26.245 --> 00:04:28.557
今晚留下来陪我。
Stay with me tonight.

00:04:28.857 --> 00:04:31.157
你：那声狼嚎是怎么回事？是在叫你吗？
You: What was that wolf howl? Was it calling you?
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 12 轮 · Realtime round 12）

00:04:31.257 --> 00:04:36.081
那是族群在召我。
That's the pack. Calling me.

00:04:41.305 --> 00:04:43.617
Alpha，Harland召集了长老，要你今晚就去。
Alpha. Harland called the elders. Tonight.

00:04:46.329 --> 00:04:48.641
那就让他们当面听我的答复。
Then they'll hear my answer in person.

00:04:51.453 --> 00:04:53.753
你：拉住他的手：我跟你去
You: Take his hand: I'll go with you
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 13 轮 · Realtime round 13）

00:04:57.202 --> 00:05:00.352
你愿意来？
You'd come?

00:05:03.901 --> 00:05:06.213
待在我身边。
Then stay close.

00:05:11.437 --> 00:05:13.749
他们怕的是我会做什么。
They fear what I'll do.

00:05:14.049 --> 00:05:16.349
你：我可以陪你进去，但你不许再瞒我。
You: I can go in with you, but you can't keep hiding things from me anymore.
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 14 轮 · Realtime round 14）

00:05:16.449 --> 00:05:21.273
成交。不再瞒你。
Deal. No more secrets.

00:05:26.497 --> 00:05:28.307
他们要你，因为你是我的Mate。
They want you because you're my Mate.

00:05:30.516 --> 00:05:32.326
画外：把她交出来，Magnus。
Hand her over, Magnus.

00:05:36.645 --> 00:05:38.945
你：走到他身边，握紧他的手
You: Walk over to his side and grip his hand tightly
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 15 轮 · Realtime round 15）

00:05:39.045 --> 00:05:43.869
你来了。
You came.

00:05:54.117 --> 00:05:56.429
一步也不退。
Not one step back.

00:05:59.241 --> 00:06:01.541
你：什么期限？他们凭什么决定我去哪？我不走。
You: What deadline? What gives them the right to decide where I go? I'm not leaving.
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 16 轮 · Realtime round 16）

00:06:01.641 --> 00:06:06.465
在满月之前。
Until the full moon.

00:06:11.689 --> 00:06:14.001
没人能替你决定。
Nobody decides that for you.

00:06:16.713 --> 00:06:19.025
她留下。有话当面对我说。
She stays. Say it to my face.

00:06:21.837 --> 00:06:24.137
你：迈步站到他身前
You: Step forward to stand in front of him
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 17 轮 · Realtime round 17）

00:06:24.237 --> 00:06:29.061
你在护着我？
You're shielding me?

00:06:34.285 --> 00:06:36.597
我护着你，不是反过来。
I protect you. Not the reverse.

00:06:39.309 --> 00:06:41.621
来，我们走。
Come. We're leaving.

00:06:44.433 --> 00:06:46.733
你：别回头。带我回去，路上把剩下的都告诉我。
You: Don't look back. Take me home, and tell me the rest on the way.
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 18 轮 · Realtime round 18）

00:06:51.857 --> 00:06:56.681
不回头。
Not looking back.

00:06:56.881 --> 00:06:59.193
Arkwright家想在满月前得到你。
Arkwright wants you before the moon.

00:07:01.905 --> 00:07:04.217
长老会碰不了Mate的血脉。
Elders can't touch my Mate's blood.
